    {
      "text": "WHO-recommended rapid diagnostic tests for TB in children and adolescents (Xpert MTB/RIF, Xpert Ultra, Truenat MTB and MTB Plus, TB-LAMP, LF-LAM), listing the specimen types each can be used with and whether it detects rifampicin resistance.",
